  "_comment": "Shared conformance cases for blocklist matching. Every implementation (waddle_core.privacy.Blocklist and the capture helper's blocklist) evaluates each case against the DEFAULT list in knowledge/privacy/default-blocklist.json plus the case's extra_classes / extra_titles, and must reach 'expect'. Semantics: case-insensitive substring; class patterns over class, name and desktop; title patterns over title; blank patterns are dropped. Cases with \"unicode\": true additionally need NFKC normalization and full Unicode case folding on both sides; an implementation that only lowercases will fail exactly those. Before normalizing, both sides drop invisible characters (soft hyphen, zero-width spaces and joiners, bidi controls, word joiner, variation selectors, BOM, tags); whitespace is NOT collapsed and a tab is not a space. No case uses Waddle's own app id: own windows are handled outside the pattern matcher.",
